      "message_parsed": "<div style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(226, 80, 65)\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px\">Используйте этот мод: </span><a href=\"https://torrentpier.com/resources/sluchajnaja-razdacha.277/\" class=\"link link--internal\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px\">Случайная раздача</span></a></span>&#8203;</div><hr /><b>Описание</b>: Выводится любая раздача рандомом.<br />\n<b>.php</b><br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">$count = DB()-&gt;fetch_row(&quot;SELECT COUNT(topic_id) as count FROM &quot;. BB_BT_TORRENTS .&quot; WHERE tor_status = &quot;. TOR_APPROVED .&quot; LIMIT 1&quot;);\n$limit = mt_rand(1, $count[&#039;count&#039;]) - 1;\n$rel = DB()-&gt;fetch_row(&quot;SELECT topic_id FROM &quot;. BB_BT_TORRENTS .&quot; WHERE tor_status = &quot;. TOR_APPROVED .&quot; LIMIT $limit, 1&quot;);\n$template-&gt;assign_vars(array(\n&#039;REL_RELEALIS&#039; =&gt; $rel[&#039;topic_id&#039;],\n));</pre><b>.tpl</b><br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">&lt;span class=&quot;normal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;\n  &lt;a href=&quot;viewtopic.php?t={REL_RELEALIS}&quot;&gt;Случайная раздача&lt;/a&gt;</pre>P.S. кто захочет может сделать на ajax&#039;e",
